Feature: Update Sales Data Transformations

  Background:
    Given the Unity Catalog is "purgo_databricks"
    And the Unity Catalog Schema is "purgo_playground"
    And the table "sales_data_transformed" exists in the schema

  Scenario Outline: Update Bonus Eligibility
    Given the sales amount is <sales_amount>
    When the bonus eligibility is updated
    Then the bonus eligibility should be "<bonus_eligibility>"

    Examples:
      | sales_amount | bonus_eligibility |
      | 25001        | Yes               |
      | 25000        | No                |

  Scenario Outline: Update Performance Flag
    Given the sales amount is <sales_amount>
    When the performance flag is updated
    Then the performance flag should be "<performance_flag>"

    Examples:
      | sales_amount | performance_flag |
      | 9001         | High             |
      | 9000         | Medium           |
      | 7001         | Medium           |
      | 7000         | Low              |

  Scenario Outline: Update Product Performance Band
    Given the sales amount is <sales_amount>
    When the product performance band is updated
    Then the product performance band should be "<product_perf_band>"

    Examples:
      | sales_amount | product_perf_band |
      | 10001        | Excellent         |
      | 10000        | Good              |
      | 8001         | Good              |
      | 8000         | Moderate          |
      | 5001         | Moderate          |
      | 5000         | Poor              |

  Scenario Outline: Update Rep Tier
    Given the total sales amount is <total_sales_amount>
    When the rep tier is updated
    Then the rep tier should be "<rep_tier>"

    Examples:
      | total_sales_amount | rep_tier      |
      | 45001              | Platinum Plus |
      | 45000              | Platinum      |
      | 35001              | Platinum      |
      | 35000              | Gold          |
      | 25001              | Gold          |
      | 25000              | Silver        |

  Scenario: Display Output
    Given the sales data is updated
    When the output is displayed
    Then the updated sales data should be displayed
